OL,3,GNEWSAWhat has happened to the 2022
OL,4,ALeicester disorder inquiry?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is exactly four years since violent
OL,7,Funrest in Leicester raised fundamental
OL,8,Fquestions about the city's reputation
OL,9,Fas a model of community cohesion.
OL,11,FTensions erupted as hundreds of mainly
OL,12,Fyoung men from Hindu and Muslim
OL,13,Fcommunities faced off across police
OL,14,Flines on 17 and 18 September.
OL,16,FThe 2022 disorder prompted
OL,17,Finternational headlines, with rival
OL,18,Fnarratives about how agitators stoked
OL,19,Ftensions on social media, and whether
OL,20,Fdivisive South Asian religious politics
OL,21,Fwere playing out on UK streets.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
