OL,3,GNEWSAWhat has happened to the 2022
OL,4,ALeicester disorder inquiry?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government commissioned an
OL,7,Findependent review into what happened.
OL,8,FFormer Labour MP Lord Ian Austin was
OL,9,Fappointed to lead the review when it
OL,10,Flaunched in 2023.
